Tailor your weapons to match your style and team up with friends to secure victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Combat<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576070/extras/0c1221aa27025ab1b7db9594f76a1a15.poster.avif?t=1772767323\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576070/extras/0c1221aa27025ab1b7db9594f76a1a15.webm?t=1772767323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576070/extras/0c1221aa27025ab1b7db9594f76a1a15.mp4?t=1772767323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Nowadays, FPS games can often be overwhelming and time-consuming. We understand that not everyone can indulge in all-day gaming or wander around in an unnecessarily large map only to be eliminated in seconds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sudden Attack Zero Point offers quick, action-packed battles, allowing you to enjoy intense gameplay and fully embrace the thrill of combat without unnecessary delays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization For Victory<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576070/extras/7ae476a588cbf05511f4a8cdcfa98d36.avif?t=1772767323\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with an extensive weapon customization system, letting you build the perfect gun for your playstyle! Customize various gun parts to your liking, including weapon recoil, reload speed, appearance and more.\u00a0Through gun customization, even the same weapon can offer a unique combat experience, allowing you to enjoy diverse and exciting battles.\u00a0Stand out on the battlefield with a weapon that's truly yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Tactical Experience<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576070/extras/56026b0e5a579e9efeb07416a0675c55.avif?t=1772767323\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in strategic combat focused on bomb defusal modes, where teamwork and tactics are essential for outsmarting your opponents. Each match demands precise coordination and communication to ensure victory. In addition to these thrilling bomb defusal modes, a variety of other game modes await. Strategize with your team and dominate your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade &amp; Gear Up!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576070/extras/5cf944492b35437582c44fe1df8261be.avif?t=1772767323\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in the Black Market, where you can trade weapon skins, parts, and other items that you earned in the game with fellow players. Upgrade your weapons and customize your setups to suit your preferences, giving you a competitive edge. With the right modifications, you can truly dominate the battlefield with your favorite weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["NEXON Games Co., Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576070/a49df50ab2d45bac938ec8c6f01d9a362da6c034/header.jpg?t=1772767323","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u24d2 NEXON Korea Corporation All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3576070/854601/2d362691a967f6d6b19e9754358acb85d94016dd/1750470015/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742644550","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steams